{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾遊走灣仔與大埔，發掘三間極具特色的美食餐廳！從精緻的高級中法Fusion料理，到全港首創的無竹簾東京風手卷吧，再到大埔街坊強力推介的平民爆漿小食，為大家呈獻一場豐富的味覺盛宴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>灣仔中法Fusion料理：創新演繹高級食材</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">節目首站，由葉世昌大廚帶領主持波波（黃婧靈）展開一趟中法Fusion料理之旅，品嚐多款精緻佳餚：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Les Saveurs Private Kitchen</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：灣仔告士打道229-230號宇宙商業大廈10樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b82adf37-5b5a-4821-8024-fb4589cbe9b0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026A1aTREEHB51788405385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b82adf37-5b5a-4821-8024-fb4589cbe9b0.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"84050d1a-564f-4a2f-8aeb-7f1efb90460d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026HYk2aqzUvV1788405384.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"84050d1a-564f-4a2f-8aeb-7f1efb90460d.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d9065714-1acc-486f-9c70-25548290981c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bc96xE04G51788405384.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d9065714-1acc-486f-9c70-25548290981c.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3f96a3a6-31a0-4aab-a338-f458465fd90e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026nEn14RrqW21788405384.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3f96a3a6-31a0-4aab-a338-f458465fd90e.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>東京風手卷吧：脆口紫菜包裹鮮味</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二節由黃嘉雯與胡美貽接棒，造訪位於灣仔的全港首間東京風手卷吧。東京式手卷的最大特色，在於製作過程不需依賴竹簾，而是師傅直接用手將鮮美食材與紫菜包裹成形，此做法能令紫菜保持特別鬆脆及保留濃郁香氣：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">赤身手卷： 搭配銀魚仔，鮮味十足。</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">椰子蝦手卷： 外層金黃酥脆，口感獨特。</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Rorubaru</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：灣仔皇后大道東100號地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9aa6cad8-474c-43b0-a3cd-d1f0337a1913.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026CfwiK1EWwS1788405383.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9aa6cad8-474c-43b0-a3cd-d1f0337a1913.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1dadd173-e6e3-40dc-a9b7-0fde9503fc58.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026r4kQRGfRMe1788405386.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1dadd173-e6e3-40dc-a9b7-0fde9503fc58.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"18ae1775-6741-4108-8d5b-499fda11b8c2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026DvANgAEIF81788405386.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"18ae1775-6741-4108-8d5b-499fda11b8c2.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"aa20ba6f-ecd3-465c-a8f4-a606ffd4d9ca.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pog1OFi6Qv1788405386.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"aa20ba6f-ecd3-465c-a8f4-a606ffd4d9ca.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>大埔街坊推介平民美食：爆漿煎餃與足料糖水</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後一節，伍倩彤帶領黃嘉雯前往大埔掃街，發掘深受當地街坊大力推介的平民美食：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">洪記餃子雲吞糖水</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：大埔寶鄉街47號地下D2號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"75855634-1c43-4258-99b6-934ef64da62c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MxwoG8ZISn1788405385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"75855634-1c43-4258-99b6-934ef64da62c.png.webp\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bfdcea08-e8c2-4e6f-b563-5c0473c1cbfd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pkM10Dl77l1788405385.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bfdcea08-e8c2-4e6f-b563-5c0473c1cbfd.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T13:39:55.902155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":492,"images":10,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}